<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Violinist Menuhin's mother seriously ill.</title>
<headline>Violinist Menuhin's mother seriously ill.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Violinist Yehudi Menuhin has cut short a visit to South Africa because his 100-year-old mother has fallen ill in San Francisco, the sponsors of the musician's visit said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Her physicians do not expect her to live,&quot; a statement said.</p>
<p>Menuhin arrived in South Africa on Monday to conduct a series of concerts as part of a world tour celebrating his 80th birthday.</p>
</text>
